And that's my own fault.

00:36:23.020 --> 00:36:33.900
Keep in mind. And, but I just wanted to bring up another, you know, maybe loosely related to conflict, but say you did get this game and, uh, you're not entirely into it or whatever.

00:36:34.080 --> 00:36:40.980
I don't know about you, but when I was a kid, if I received a game or if I bought a game, that was now my game.

